    // ═══ Class 10 English — completed 2026-08-31 ═══
    // First Flight is 9 prose chapters interleaved with 10 poems. We held
    // only the prose, and two of those — The Hundred Dresses I and II —
    // were rationalised out in 2023 and are now retired. The supplementary
    // reader Footprints Without Feet (9 stories) was absent entirely; the
